{"h":3106,"lines":[{"x":0.77799543042458008,"h":0.021433015370169395,"y":0.064864887635670332,"t":"Speaking","c":1,"w":0.090625680287679033},{"t":"SPEAKING","w":0.14661654154459636,"h":0.018895348808647183,"y":0.11337209290257011,"c":1,"x":0.39473684128462994},{"c":1,"h":0.016359678024026714,"x":0.071376180117718915,"w":0.094089743296305331,"y":0.18004690501756948,"t":"PART 1"},{"x":0.080827055507257717,"c":1,"h":0.020419031132134946,"y":0.20784883735932835,"t":"The examiner asks the candidate about him\/herself, his\/her home, work or studies and","w":0.76691731770833327},{"c":1,"h":0.018949083720033344,"y":0.22878605496021898,"t":"other familiar topics.","x":0.071118062544054741,"w":0.18299354553222658},{"w":0.097744363149007168,"c":1,"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.071428570213128761,"t":"EXAMPLE","y":0.25726744204556828},{"y":0.28779069790296119,"t":"Age","w":0.039473683039347326,"h":0.015988371407532842,"c":1,"x":0.071428571759058881},{"t":"- Are you happy to be the age you are now? [Why\/Why not?]","h":0.024751042981955296,"y":0.31240467487072443,"c":1,"x":0.069440302806558288,"w":0.56043472290039065},{"t":"- When you were a child, did you think a lot about your future? [Why\/Why not?]","x":0.067669161237125283,"y":0.33129426918273963,"c":1,"w":0.72368423461914066,"h":0.018996428460823056},{"t":"Do you think you have changed as you have got older? [Why\/Why not?]","h":0.018615090148493385,"x":0.095814640534480258,"y":0.35093028290393757,"w":0.64672815958658858,"c":1},{"t":"What will be different about your life in the future? [Why]","x":0.095864665958046935,"y":0.37057308459237703,"h":0.017508310881723443,"c":1,"w":0.50563908894856779},{"w":0.097819264729817709,"h":0.016263640011347058,"c":1,"y":0.40393213346728341,"x":0.07139111942257502,"t":"PART 2"},{"t":"Describe a time when you started using a new","x":0.092105254925338234,"y":0.45058139518397056,"h":0.017544812106042196,"w":0.44548873901367186,"c":1},{"y":0.46941403735736908,"t":"technological device (e.g. a new computer or phone).","w":0.51691731770833338,"h":0.017504567418341055,"c":1,"x":0.090225551597905282},{"w":0.15705614725748696,"x":0.09159670740760438,"h":0.020476005342953907,"c":1,"y":0.50326854369871388,"t":"You should say:"},{"t":"what device you started using","y":0.52470930204818522,"w":0.29135337829589841,"c":1,"x":0.13533834834991476,"h":0.015988372635703185},{"t":"why you started using this device","x":0.13519486029351896,"y":0.54158006613025245,"w":0.3254680887858073,"h":0.019416438174570172,"c":1},{"w":0.32556821187337237,"x":0.13514042204589016,"y":0.55921159872087767,"t":"how easy or difficult it was to use","h":0.020193852844041738,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.090225558424776586,"w":0.46052632649739583,"t":"and explain how helpful this device was to you.","y":0.57984546047722685,"h":0.016097875080489432},{"w":0.1804511260986329,"c":1,"h":0.014647194591554058,"x":0.64285714362361579,"t":"You will have to talk","y":0.45058139554104071},{"c":1,"x":0.64285714569693486,"h":0.016097875080489321,"y":0.4694140372074378,"t":"about the topic for one","w":0.20488721211751293},{"x":0.64080652160539031,"t":"to two minutes. You","w":0.18081104278564453,"c":1,"h":0.017742116452798662,"y":0.48657962107544273},{"c":1,"h":0.014553601866143073,"x":0.64285714603467592,"y":0.50579523499787571,"t":"have one minute to","w":0.17481202443440746},{"c":1,"h":0.018601864595529927,"x":0.64072097281319917,"y":0.52257037865319134,"w":0.19040170033772785,"t":"think about what you"},{"w":0.19225442250569658,"h":0.020102188346160288,"c":1,"x":0.64259749465893967,"y":0.54166882570568287,"t":"are going to say. You"},{"x":0.64285714495346336,"y":0.56245975535852177,"w":0.20112781524658208,"t":"can make some notes","h":0.013200257566001294,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.57882260511626804,"x":0.64078482771711809,"t":"to help you if you wish.","w":0.21273293813069671,"h":0.019431844958165967},{"x":0.07135996565333573,"h":0.016486236685257283,"c":1,"t":"PART 3","w":0.096001873016357417,"y":0.6363789743577587},{"h":0.017496144011645454,"t":"Discussion topics:","w":0.20112781524658202,"x":0.06954887422248722,"y":0.66569767428005111,"c":1},{"t":"Technology and education","x":0.071428565779397671,"h":0.016137183902344976,"c":1,"w":0.25375940958658855,"y":0.69607211868802377},{"y":0.72376046372194769,"c":1,"h":0.016097875080489321,"w":0.17857143402099607,"t":"Example questions:","x":0.071428568582390425},{"c":1,"t":"What is the best age for children to start computer lessons?","y":0.7412476052370538,"h":0.018622400832805641,"x":0.0694945125900963,"w":0.53584182739257802},{"t":"Do you think that schools should use more technology to help children learn?","y":0.76014166132261318,"x":0.069548869197093716,"w":0.69172932942708343,"c":1,"h":0.017474617869026488},{"y":0.77759041431278364,"h":0.020374637070733725,"c":1,"x":0.069504178272277048,"t":"Do you agree or disagree that computers will replace teachers one day?","w":0.64860778808593744},{"y":0.80811332913306277,"t":"Technology and society","x":0.069548877142189172,"w":0.22932329813639324,"h":0.016097875080489432,"c":1},{"x":0.07142857122759097,"t":"Example questions:","y":0.83575581379930908,"w":0.17669172922770182,"h":0.01744186072217524,"c":1},{"h":0.020007055495066206,"y":0.85292978685373311,"w":0.68249074300130208,"c":1,"t":"How much has technology improved how we communicate with each other?","x":0.069483632599075709},{"y":0.87118313353879828,"h":0.020098245305087747,"c":1,"t":"Do you agree that there are still many more major technological innovations to","x":0.069493009906009415,"w":0.70125991821289069},{"t":"be made?","y":0.89153225372960476,"w":0.092575289408365874,"x":0.069291391325559198,"c":1,"h":0.015103447613835863},{"x":0.069548876710693819,"t":"Could you suggest some reasons why some people are deciding to reduce their use","c":1,"h":0.018895348808647294,"y":0.90843023256277999,"w":0.75563908894856779},{"t":"of technology?","y":0.92857488445433745,"x":0.069504615485087975,"h":0.017850231065031696,"w":0.13354715983072918,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.015988371407532842,"y":0.97093023283426649,"w":0.028195489247639927,"x":0.83834586431258351,"t":"53"}],"w":2400}